"bb_paragraph\" >There is 6 different upgrades, each counting 20 points to spend. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shield durability (max shield value) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shield regeneration rate </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic attack damage upgrade </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photon swarm damage upgrade </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death ray damage upgrade </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final blast damage upgrade</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444220/extras/6da417bd4304c66b5b4e2c54d2ec400c.avif?t=1784050794\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444220/extras/a78a8d805d4f234a420557c36e5b2be2.avif?t=1784050794\" width=600 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is 5 different ships in shipyard each having an unique passive bonus. Those bonuses are added to global and abilities upgrades. If you manage to unlock the special ship, you'll get all the bonuses. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No bonus </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shield durability bonus % </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cool down bonus % </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Damage bonus % </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shield, CD and damage bonus %</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444220/extras/c442cfa1f93c8337940619ea56bd8534.avif?t=1784050794\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444220/extras/25a2927b969497ef4881c500b15dc96f.avif?t=1784050794\" width=600 height=66 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >amazing space graphics and ambient </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >high resolution planets and stars </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >advanced GUI with customizable preferences which include controls (controller support), graphics and audio</p></li></ul>",
